                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset compares the perceived quality of the funded/published research, as defined by the SciVal FWCI, for the research reported in H2020 and the research totals for each EU28 country during the H2020 years (2014-2021). Additional data on reported publication numbers is included as context, and with the caveat that for some countries and some years the low publication numbers and the average FWCIs derived thereof need to be seen in that perspective."
